bmi-caption-value'>Een voorbeeldtekening van Lavandula angustifolia</div></div><div style='display:none;' class='wbmi-entityview-caption wbmi-entityview-hideable oo-ui-layout oo-ui-horizontalLayout'><label class='wbmi-language-label oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-labelElement-label oo-ui-labelElement oo-ui-labelWidget'>afrikaans</label><div lang='af' dir='ltr' class='wbmi-caption-value'>&#039;n Monstertekening van lavandula angustifolia</div></div><div style='display:none;' class='wbmi-entityview-caption wbmi-entityview-hideable oo-ui-layout oo-ui-horizontalLayout'><label class='wbmi-language-label oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-labelElement-label oo-ui-labelElement oo-ui-labelWidget'>italien</label><div lang='it' dir='ltr' class='wbmi-caption-value'>Un disegno esemplare di lavandula angustifolia</div></div><div style='display:none;' class='wbmi-entityview-caption wbmi-entityview-hideable oo-ui-layout oo-ui-horizontalLayout'><label class='wbmi-language-label oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-labelElement-label oo-ui-labelElement oo-ui-labelWidget'>polonais</label><div lang='pl' dir='ltr' class='wbmi-caption-value'>Rysunek okazu lawendy wąskolistnej</div></div><div style='display:none;' class='wbmi-entityview-caption wbmi-entityview-hideable oo-ui-layout oo-ui-horizontalLayout'><label class='wbmi-language-label oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-labelElement-label oo-ui-labelElement oo-ui-labelWidget'>arménien</label><div lang='hy' dir='ltr' class='wbmi-caption-value'>Lavandula angustifolia-ի գծանկարի նմուշ</div></div></div><div id="mw-imagepage-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="fr" dir="ltr"><div class="hproduct commons-file-information-table">
